      "title": "START HERE — THIN CONTROLS WITHOUT A GENERATION",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "PixaromaNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "{\"version\":1,\"content\":\"<h2>M4 THIN CONTROLS LAB</h2><ol><li>Select the evidence-cleared Gold Base or Quick Preview recipe. Turbo is intentionally absent because its comparison is not yet recorded.</li><li>Edit the JSON plan only with an explicit reset. Each queued execution reads the current shot at execution time.</li><li>Run once per shot. A matching recorded take commits accepted work and advances the plan; rejected work stays on the same shot.</li></ol><p>This lab loads one known-good frame to exercise project state and provenance. It contains no model, sampler, generation, partner node, or paid route. Gold is not connected.</p>\",\"buttonColor\":\"#f66744\",\"lineColor\":\"#f66744\",\"width\":3060,\"height\":220,\"backgroundColor\":\"#2a2a2a\"}",
        ""
